// # MCP QA Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the 6 self-test probe drivers for the MCP server.
//
// Setup: Each probe is a hostile test for one MCP method or behavior. If a driver fails, the mcp/ package fails to release.
//
// Beats:
//   1. probe_initialize.oo — server lifecycle, capabilities, session state.
//   2. probe_tools_list.oo — tool enumeration and metadata.
//   3. probe_tool_call.oo — tool dispatch and result wrapping.
//   4. probe_resources_list.oo — resource enumeration.
//   5. probe_heartbeat.oo — health probe response.
//   6. probe_double_run.oo — byte-identical determinism across 2 fresh runs.

import "probe_initialize.oo";
import "probe_tools_list.oo";
import "probe_tool_call.oo";
import "probe_resources_list.oo";
import "probe_heartbeat.oo";
import "probe_double_run.oo";
